  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to unaccompanied refugee and migrant children in the Hellenic Republic</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the development cooperation is to contribute to improving the protection and durable solutions for unaccompanied refugee and migrant children who are currently in refugee and migrant camps. 

Specific objectives: 
1. Contribute to the running of shelters for 4,000 unaccompanied refugee and migrant children in existing housing facilities in the Hellenic Republic &#x2013; mainly Athens Area. 
2. Contribute to the activation of the minors according to age group in activities such as care giving, schooling, sports, further education and job training.</narrative>
  </description>
